OL,3,AUS and Iran hold first talks since June
OL,4,Aafter Trump's 'annihilation' threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FTop Iranian and US officials have held
OL,7,Ftalks at the UN in New York on a day
OL,8,Fwhen the US leader said he could
OL,9,F"annihilate" the Islamic Republic if
OL,10,Fthe conflict went unresolved.
OL,12,FNo breakthrough has been reported from
OL,13,Fthe meeting mediated by Qatar and
OL,14,Finvolving Iran's foreign minister and
OL,15,FUS President Donald Trump's envoy Steve
OL,16,FWitkoff - the first since a June
OL,17,Fceasefire unravelled.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
