OL,3,AUS and Iran hold first talks since June
OL,4,Aafter Trump's 'annihilation' threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FWitkoff said a round of discussions had
OL,7,Fbeen completed "that we hope will prove
OL,8,Fconstructive and promising". Iran
OL,9,Frepeated its demand for the US to end
OL,10,Fits "acts of aggression".
OL,12,FThe US and Israel launched air strikes
OL,13,Fon Iran on 28 February. Iran responded
OL,14,Fby attacking Israel and US bases in the
OL,15,FGulf and Arab Gulf allies of the US -
OL,16,Fas well as blocking the Strait of
OL,17,FHormuz.
